  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-24ee350b4de3fb6c4205/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Gallery</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-20T12:25:23-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, June 20, 2020, 12:25 pm\">June 20, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div>Although the Grist Mill was not open to the public, we artists were more than rewarded with a spectacular day on this beautifully clean crisp day 6/19/20.</div>\n<div>Lots of shadows and sunshine, trickling waterfalls where the herring run, blooms, and egrets.</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"5348-1\" class=\"gallery gallery-5348 gallery-col-3 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-large\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-d51aa0fa4134002a2e09/\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/8dfadbfb5207fecaf2ff2a763beb0e2fbe522d577c8579f4e5517b1a313b3a47.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman wearing a face mask and sitting in a chair.\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-ba1daa14f3e007cdf943/\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/7c7d041b9b48b808642d7ffbc1c2a6958318ebba255d8a16e5472d028b7d584c.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A person in a hat looking at a water wheel.\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-3cebf20bb908cd7ce097/\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/c9adf9d355a519ba8c14ffd2a8f28eaa0005e9706a115a7ba5b4c08f49b6ad5e.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman holding an easel in a grassy area.\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-f18f846765e08d5a2bb7/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"961\" height=\"996\" src=\"/media/archive/78936439abafc4f116f434abc628bc1c590c0a846d076f2cb5e4912a234c53f9.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman sitting on a wooden bridge in a pond.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-7d0e7e1770480c07ea00/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/0bca710a496d0c24109931db95bfedccdd6327517cb7146a9d87e9857331e25f.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A small house with a water wheel in the middle of a wooded area.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\"><a href=\"/archive/source-9acfee31d3fb67e02475/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/media/archive/642ae8e78f4556545adc49f278d4a7e6659d1518a4142bd3dcf5d123560ba855.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Stony Brook Grist Mill\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-db7bf97bfd04688d8dcd/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/6a963c55430bf0a53db4ffe5e47584cec88f50759c8d682906409cf530afe1f4.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A stream running through a forest.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-46aaade3beebe3e99590/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/ad521ff966e618a0f280ed42957cd5f4e67f180745891db522548da6eb154101.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A stream running through a forest.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\"><a href=\"/archive/source-51b437791b14ed06f87d/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/media/archive/8db763b0c8c9641a3612ab637acb709faded89fb2e081a8849b891076ad2d558.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A small water mill sits next to a stream in a wooded area.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-33fd61271869d5118120/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/9d88220ed9d22cefda00e40e3867383a816388b9d7a5413ddc8aa8e2cd0618bb.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman sitting on a rock next to a stream.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-46c425946f3e92b8ebb7/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/c40315baad486cf920b4c2c49974af51297ff688c60e6b931c84e22adf952708.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A person painting on a stand.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-300412689410777ce9b5/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/3dd2f9a5b021d379d418b6028d7e86ec90d2737a4b1bcc4eb8b66e021b88d15a.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman in a hat sitting on a rock next to a lake.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-ea153407f937ad357251/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/a657ebe83471f40338b45fd568bbccff0d96068ae0141ac400a491af7cd69f8b.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman is painting on an easel near a stream.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-1948dc5f1d563e977436/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1022\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/d8391a2300abbd5d3feb60d3b37abed4dc11a26d84b6fe35b7ed2fe4b8426a65.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Join us for our weekly en plein air.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-4790364e6b04dc9a7b2b/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/a1f49318aa88543839d760c64529bf207718433486b0c785e016d66e3b0d6025.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman in a hat standing next to an easel in a park.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-5d6b6eacd2e848cf3e65/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/0d16f431092e2a5b1a18bb85507290e7c5092308a492b9729f14d50f02506e81.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A woman standing next to a lake.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-32cd4b4ee490840b3094/\" rel=\"tag\">EN PLEIN AIR</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-74004cd9be5de0d40a61/\" rel=\"tag\">EVENTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>